sequenceDiagram
    participant PIX as Etherfuse Webhook
    participant Backend
    participant Orchestrator
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Note over PIX,DB: PIX Funding Webhook
    PIX->>Backend: POST /api/webhooks — PIX payment confirmed
    Backend->>Orchestrator: confirmPixFunding(transferId)
    Orchestrator->>DB: transition_transfer() → PIX_FUNDED
    DB-->>Orchestrator: state_version incremented

    Note over PIX,DB: Duplicate Webhook (Idempotency)
    PIX->>Backend: Same webhook arrives again
    Backend->>Orchestrator: confirmPixFunding(transferId)
    Orchestrator->>Orchestrator: PIX already funded — idempotent
    Orchestrator->>DB: Append idempotent_replay event
    DB-->>Orchestrator: No state change

    Note over PIX,DB: Circle Webhook (Payout Complete)
    participant Circle as Circle Webhook
    Circle->>Backend: POST /api/transfers/payout-events/circle
    Backend->>Orchestrator: handlePayoutProviderEvent()
    Orchestrator->>Orchestrator: Same-name check + status normalization
    Orchestrator->>DB: transition_transfer() → RECONCILED
    DB-->>Orchestrator: state_version 9

    Note over PIX,DB: Webhook Authorization
    Circle->>Backend: POST /api/transfers/payout-events/circle
    Backend->>Backend: Validate x-payout-webhook-secret header
    Backend->>Backend: timingSafeEqualString() check
    alt Secret matches
        Backend->>Orchestrator: handlePayoutProviderEvent()
    else Secret mismatch
        Backend-->>Circle: 401 Unauthorized
    end
